# Go's formatters emit LF, and the Windows CI runner checks out with
# core.autocrlf=true by default — so every .go file arrived as CRLF there and
# failed gofmt while passing on Linux and macOS. (Only three files were listed
# in the log because golangci-lint caps repeats of one issue at three.)
#
# Normalise to LF in the repository and check out LF everywhere. Nothing here
# is consumed by a tool that needs CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
